                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1] Experienced on the Oculus Rift with Touch Controllers [/h1]\n\nLooks like I'm the first reviewer to actually buy this game and give a non-biased review. I really don't like Streamers who beg for free keys on Steam. But I digress, I recommend this game on sale. I think the current sale price of $1.39 is more appropriate than the normal price of $6.99 which is too pricey for what you're getting IMO. You teleport around the area and select 1 of 5 games. The graphics/ 3D is kind of weird, the buildings looked curved, warped. \n\nSome of the mini-games are more fun than others. The most fun is the bow & arrow mini-game. Amazingly, the bow mechanic feels good. That really surprised me. I was expecting it to be bad. There's only 3 waves, but it's fun to complete the game. Maybe it takes 3-4 minutes to finish. There's even a little depth to the game. \n\nThe rollercoaster was just okay. I think it's perfect for anyone who gets motion sickness in VR or kids because it's a very gentle and easy-going ride. Don't expect thrills or chills in this ride.\n\nThe shuriken throwing game wasn't really that fun. It's just throwing a shuriken at a 3 targets of increasing distance. You're supposed to score a certain score and the game ends. Pretty bland, not fun.\n\nSave the kitty. You need full roomscale for this mini-game. It's really just a walk the plank mini-game. It's not bad. It's supposed to give you a fear of heights. But that doesnt' really happen for me in VR. Again, think kids would love this more than an adult.\n\nAnother mini-game is just dressing up a snowman. There's supposedly a way to win this game, but I didn't get a key afterwards so I'm confused on how to finish it. Still, you just dress up the snowman. I actually had fun doing it. I just wish there were more props / costumes.\n\nFind the ghost. I could not get this mini-game to work. I am unsure if this is related to Oculus compatibility or not. I saw the video, I know what you're supposed to do. I left a note for the dev on this mini-game. I'm not color-blind.\n\nNormal Price Rating 5/10. Sale Price Rating 6/10. Overall 5.5/10.",
